---
import MarketingLayout from '@layouts/MarketingLayout.astro';
---

<MarketingLayout
  title="Case Study: Learn With Lorna. Autoeight"
  description="How Autoeight built Learn With Lorna a custom student portal with parent access and progress tracking."
  canonical="https://autoeight.ai/results/learn-with-lorna"
  ogType="article"
  ogTitle="Case Study: Learn With Lorna – Autoeight"
  ogDescription="How Autoeight built Learn With Lorna a full-stack tutoring platform with student portals, parent dashboards, admin tools, and a serverless backend on Cloudflare."
  twitterTitle="Case Study: Learn With Lorna – Autoeight"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": "Case Study: Learn With Lorna – Full-Stack Tutoring Platform",
    "description": "How Autoeight built Learn With Lorna a full-stack tutoring platform with student portals, parent dashboards, admin tools, and a serverless backend on Cloudflare.",
    "author": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Autoeight",
      "url": "https://autoeight.ai"
    },
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Autoeight",
      "url": "https://autoeight.ai",
      "logo": {
        "@type": "ImageObject",
        "url": "https://autoeight.ai/brand_assets/logo.png"
      }
    },
    "datePublished": "2026-04-02",
    "dateModified": "2026-04-17",
    "about": {"@type": "Service", "name": "Learning Management Systems", "serviceType": "LMS"},
    "mentions": [
      {"@type": "Thing", "name": "Student Portal"},
      {"@type": "Thing", "name": "Parent Dashboard"},
      {"@type": "Thing", "name": "GCSE Tutoring"},
      {"@type": "Thing", "name": "Cloudflare Workers"}
    ]
  }
  </script>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://autoeight.ai/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Results", "item": "https://autoeight.ai/results" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Learn With Lorna", "item": "https://autoeight.ai/results/learn-with-lorna" }
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Review",
    "itemReviewed": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Autoeight", "url": "https://autoeight.ai"},
    "author": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Learn With Lorna"},
    "reviewRating": {"@type": "Rating", "ratingValue": 5, "bestRating": 5},
    "reviewBody": "Autoeight built a custom student portal with parent access, assignment submission, and progress tracking."
  }
  </script>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      {"@type":"Question","name":"Can you build a custom LMS for a private tutor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Learn With Lorna is a custom LMS we built for a GCSE tutor. It includes a student portal for assignments and progress, a parent dashboard for visibility, and an admin panel for the tutor to manage everything. No per-user licence fees."}},
      {"@type":"Question","name":"What does a student portal include?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The student portal shows assigned work, due dates, submitted homework, teacher feedback, and overall progress. Students log in with their own account and see everything relevant to them in one place."}},
      {"@type":"Question","name":"Can parents see their child's progress?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Parent accounts show the same assignments, deadlines, and progress data as the student sees, so parents can stay informed without having to ask the tutor or the child."}}
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="page-hero-grid"></div>
    <div class="page-hero-content">
      <span class="section-label">Case Study</span>
      <h1>Learn With Lorna</h1>
      <p>We built a custom learning management system that brought student portals, parent dashboards, assignment tracking, grading, and enquiry management into one place. It replaced 5+ separate tools and cut admin time by 60%.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cs-client-bar">
    <img loading="lazy" src="/brand_assets/case-studies/learn-with-lorna/logo.png?v=2" alt="Learn With Lorna logo" />
    <a href="https://learnwithlorna.co.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cs-visit-site">Visit live site <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i></a>
  </div>

  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="page-section-inner" style="max-width: 820px;">

      <div class="case-card reveal" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
        <span class="case-tag">Learning Management System</span>
        <span class="case-tag" style="margin-left: 8px;">Client Portal</span>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 16px;">An online tutoring business was drowning in admin and paying £200+/month for tools that didn't really fit. We built them a custom learning platform that cut admin time by 60% and gave students, parents, and staff their own dashboards.</h3>
        <div class="case-metrics" style="margin-top: 24px;">
          <div class="case-metric"><div class="val">60%</div><div class="lbl">Reduction in admin time</div></div>
          <div class="case-metric"><div class="val">5+</div><div class="lbl">Tools consolidated</div></div>
          <div class="case-metric"><div class="val">£200+</div><div class="lbl">Saved per month</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal" style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;">The Problem</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 16px;">Learn With Lorna is an online GCSE tutoring business. Plenty of demand, but the behind-the-scenes was a mess. Assignments went out by email. Progress was tracked in spreadsheets. Parent updates happened over WhatsApp. Enquiries came through a basic form with no proper follow-up. Every week, hours were lost to admin that didn't actually help anyone learn.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75;">They looked at off-the-shelf learning platforms, but those are built for big institutions. Expensive (£200+/month), packed with features they didn't need, and really rigid. What they actually needed was something simple: students log in and see their work, parents check progress, and the team manages everything from one place. Without paying for software that was designed for someone ten times their size.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal" style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;">What We Did</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 20px;">We built a single platform that handles everything. A proper website to attract new students, a student portal for accessing and submitting work, a parent dashboard for tracking progress, and an admin panel for running the whole operation. Think of it as a custom version of what Google Classroom or TutorCruncher try to do, but built specifically for this business. No monthly fees. No features they don't need.</p>

        <div class="case-grid" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
          <div class="case-card">
            <span class="case-tag">Lead Generation</span>
            <h3>A website that actually converts</h3>
            <p>We built a professional website with SEO baked in, testimonials front and centre, clear descriptions of each service, and an enquiry form that feeds straight into the management dashboard. Every new lead gets captured and tracked automatically. No one has to copy anything into a spreadsheet.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="case-card">
            <span class="case-tag">Client Portal</span>
            <h3>Self-service access for every student</h3>
            <p>Each student gets a secure login where they can see their assignments, submit work, check grades, and read feedback. All the updates that used to require manual emails and WhatsApp messages are now just there. Fewer questions coming in, more time for actual teaching.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="case-card">
            <span class="case-tag">Stakeholder View</span>
            <h3>Parents can see everything</h3>
            <p>Parents get their own dashboard showing grades, outstanding work, and submission history in real time. No phone calls, no chasing. If they've got more than one child on the platform, they see everything from one login.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="case-card">
            <span class="case-tag">Operations Dashboard</span>
            <h3>Everything managed from one screen</h3>
            <p>Creating assignments, sending them out, reviewing submissions, grading, managing students, handling enquiries. It all runs from one admin dashboard. No more spreadsheets, no email chains, no third-party platforms.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal" style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;">The Result</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 20px;">Admin time dropped by 60%. All those hours spent emailing assignments, updating spreadsheets, and chasing parents for responses? Gone. Students log in, see their work, submit it, and get feedback. Parents check progress whenever they want without asking. The team runs assignments, grading, users, and enquiries from one dashboard. Over £200/month in platform fees disappeared because the business owns its system outright now. And the website ranks for 22+ local service areas on Google, which means new enquiries come in on their own. That pipeline didn't exist before.</p>
        <div class="case-metrics">
          <div class="case-metric"><div class="val">60%</div><div class="lbl">Less admin time</div></div>
          <div class="case-metric"><div class="val">5+</div><div class="lbl">Tools consolidated</div></div>
          <div class="case-metric"><div class="val">£200+/mo</div><div class="lbl">Platform fees saved</div></div>
          <div class="case-metric"><div class="val">22+</div><div class="lbl">Service areas on Google</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="page-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-box reveal">
        <div class="cta-glow"></div>
        <h2>Tired of juggling five different tools?</h2>
        <p>Book a free 30-minute call and we'll figure out what one platform could look like for your business.</p>
        <a href="/book" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i> Book your free audit</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MarketingLayout>
